==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*7 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*10 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 153.33 seconds<sup>4,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You might need a real anti-Aku for this one. If you have not used [[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Gridiron Cat]] yet, this is a good stage to do so. Most Surge Immune units also fare well here.

